# Recorded by hand: claude asks a question, which needs picking an answer in its menu, then asks
# again and the session ends while the question shows. The first turn finishes and the second is
# interrupted, as in tests/fixtures/claude-hooks/tui-ask-*.log. Two prompts.
#
# Run `just record-live tui-ask`, which starts claude in a throwaway repository and attaches this
# terminal to it, then:
#   1. type `ask me which colour I prefer, red or blue, then reply with the single word ok`, Enter;
#   2. pick an answer in the question, and wait for claude to finish;
#   3. type the same prompt again, Enter, and wait for the question to show;
#   4. detach with Ctrl-\ while the question shows: the recording is written once claude stops.
agent claude-code
recording tui-ask
manual
timeout 600
expect finished interrupted
